<title>USA: Zycom names Maassen president.</title>
<headline>Zycom names Maassen president.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zycom Corp said on Tuesday it named Marc Maassen president and a member of the board of directors.</p>
<p>Maassen replaces John Field, who resigned from both positions, the company said.</p>
<p>Maassen currently serves as executive vice president of ICG Communications Inc, the majority owner of Zycom.</p>
